## 1. 当前架构（Current Architecture，真实）

```mermaid
graph TB
    subgraph RUNTIME[Chat Runtime]
      CHAT[server_handlers_chat / tools]
    end
    CHAT --> FACADE[context.facade.build_context_prompt<br/>唯一装配入口]
    FACADE --> ENGINE[Context Engine<br/>Collect/Rank/Budget/Bundle/Build]

    ENGINE --> MS[MemorySource 单体]
    MS --> BSP[memory.build_system_prompt<br/>= context_prefix + memory_block]
    BSP --> PROFILE[(profile)]
    BSP --> SUM[(memory_summary)]
    BSP --> CHATLOG[(chat_log recent)]
    BSP --> LEARN[(learnings)]

    ENGINE --> UMS[UserModelSource] --> UM[(user_model)]
    ENGINE --> ES[EpisodicSource] --> EP[(episodes)]
    ENGINE --> KS[KnowledgeSource] --> KN[("knowledge/*.md")]
    ENGINE --> KS2[PersonalContext/AI/Identity/Goal/...]

    MEM[(memories)] --> DI[memory_distiller / hotspots / notes / imports]
    MEM --> MI[memory_intelligence.recall]
    MEM --> MQ[memory_query]
    MEM --> ME[memory_evolution 治理]

    EMB[embed.py] --> MV[(mem_vectors)]
    PERC[perception_runtime] --> SF[semantic_fusion]

    style MS fill:#5f1f1f,color:#fff
    style BSP fill:#5f1f1f,color:#fff
```

**问题点（红框）：** MemorySource 单体把运行时状态+记忆打包成单一 blob，且 `build_memory_block`/`build_context_prefix` 与 UserModelSource/EpisodicSource 重复读取同表。

