## 2. 目标架构（Target Architecture，设计）

```mermaid
graph TB
    subgraph RUNTIME[Chat Runtime]
      CHAT[server_handlers_chat / tools]
    end
    CHAT --> FACADE[Context Facade<br/>SINGLE ENTRY]
    FACADE --> ENGINE[Context Engine<br/>Collect→Retrieve→Rank→Budget→Dedupe→Assemble→Build]

    ENGINE --> RMS[EvolvedMemorySource] --> MEM[(memories 唯一 Canonical)]
    ENGINE --> RT[RuntimeStateSource] --> RB[(reminders/geo/foci/tasks/hotspot)]
    ENGINE --> UMS[UserModelSource] --> UM[(user_model)]
    ENGINE --> ES[EpisodicSource] --> EP[(episodes)]
    ENGINE --> KS[KnowledgeSource] --> KN[("knowledge/*.md")]
    ENGINE --> IDS[IdentitySource/Goal/Personal...]

    MEM --> API[Canonical Memory API]
    API --> EV[memory_evolution 治理<br/>importance/conflict/consolidation/lifecycle/retrieval_policy]
    EV --> RET[DefaultEvolutionPolicy 唯一检索]
    EV --> LC[lifecycle 状态机]
    MEM --> EB[(EventBus 唯一事件)]

    KN --> KRT[knowledge_runtime] --> KS
    EMB[embed.py 共享] --> MV[(mem_vectors scope=memory/episode)]
    PERC[perception_runtime] --> SF[semantic_fusion Perception]

    style MEM fill:#1f5f3a,color:#fff
    style RET fill:#5f3a1f,color:#fff
    style FACADE fill:#3a1f5f,color:#fff
    style EB fill:#1f3a5f,color:#fff
    style KN fill:#1f4f5f,color:#fff
```

**五权威各一：**
1. Memory = `memories` + `memory_evolution`
2. Retrieval = `DefaultEvolutionPolicy`
3. Context Assembly = `context.facade`
4. Knowledge = `knowledge_runtime`
5. Lifecycle/Event = `lifecycle` + `eventbus`

